" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^2+3x\\text{ so }f'(x)=2x+3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^2+6x+5\\text{ so }f'(x)=2x+6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=2x^2+x-10\\text{ so }f'(x)=4x+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^2+8x+16\\text{ so }f'(x)=2x+8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^3-x^2\\text{ so }f'(x)=3x^2-2x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=(x^2+4x+4)(5x-1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=5x^3+19x^2+16x+16\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{so }f'(x)=15x^2+38x+16\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">g)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=7x^2-x^4\\text{ so }f'(x)=14x-4x^3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">h)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=9x^3-x\\text{ so }f'(x)=27x^2-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">i)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=7-x^{-1}+8x\\text{ so }f'(x)=x^{-2}+8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">j)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\left(x+\\frac1x\\right)(x^2+2+x^{-2})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=x^3+3x+3x^{-1}+x^{-3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{so }f'(x)=3x^2+3-3x^{-2}-3x^{-4}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">k)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=(x+p)(x+q)=x^2+(p+q)x+pq\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{so }f'(x)=2x+p+q\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">l)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=(x-a)\\left(x+\\frac1a\\right)=x^2-ax+\\frac1ax-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=x^2+\\frac{1-a^2}a x-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{so }f'(x)=2x+\\frac{1-a^2}a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Write each of the following in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{x^5}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac1{x^4}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(x\\sqrt{x})^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt[3]{x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac1{\\sqrt{x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac1{x\\sqrt{x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac1{x\\times\\sqrt[a]{x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^{1/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^{5/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^{-4}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3x^{3/2}=x^{9/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^{1/3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^{-1/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">g)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^1x^{-1/2}=x^{1/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">h)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^{-1}x^{-1/2}=x^{-3/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">i)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^{-1}x^{-1/a}=x^{-1-1/a}=x^{-(a+1)/a}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Write each of the following in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ax^b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\sqrt[3]{x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{4x^3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac3{x^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2x\\sqrt{x})^5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{\\sqrt[8]{x}}3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac4{\\sqrt{x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{3x}{\\sqrt{9x^4}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac5{x\\sqrt{16x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac2{\\sqrt{25ax}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&gt;0\" data-display=\