"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^4}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{2x}{\\sqrt{16x^4}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=x^{1/4}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac14x^{-3/4}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=3x^{5/2}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{15}2x^{3/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=5x^{-3}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=-15x^{-4}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=x^3x^{3/2}=x^{9/2}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac92x^{7/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\frac15x^{1/3}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac1{15}x^{-2/3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=3x^{-1/2}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac32x^{-3/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">g)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=x^1x^{-2}=x^{-1}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=-x^{-2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">h)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=2x4^{-1}x^{-2}=\\frac12x^{-1}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac12x^{-2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f'(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for each of these:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\sqrt{x}(x+2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\sqrt{x}(x^2-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{x^3+4x}{x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{2x^3+4x^{-2}}x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{9x-1}{x^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2+2x-1}{\\sqrt{x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2-5x^{-3/2}+1}{\\sqrt{x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^{3/2}+2x^{1/2}\\text{ so }f'(x)=\\frac32x^{1/2}+x^{-1/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^{5/2}-x^{1/2}\\text{ so }f'(x)=\\frac52x^{3/2}-\\frac12x^{-1/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^2+4\\text{ so }f'(x)=2x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=2x^2+4x^{-3}\\text{ so }f'(x)=4x-12x^{-4}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=9x^{-1}-x^{-2}\\text{ so }f'(x)=-9x^{-2}+2x^{-3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^{3/2}+2x^{1/2}-x^{-1/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{so }f'(x)=\\frac32x^{1/2}+x^{-1/2}+\\frac12x^{-3/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">g)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^{3/2}-5x^{-2}+x^{-1/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{so }f'(x)=\\frac32x^{1/2}+10x^{-3}-\\frac12x^{-3/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>For each of the following, find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^3+x^{-3}+2x^2-5x+8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac1{12}x^4+\\dfrac18x^2+7x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-x^3-2x^{-1/2}+15x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-x^{1/7}-x^{-1/7}-\\dfrac19x+\\dfrac19\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^3(2x+x^{-2})\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sqrt{16x^3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac2{\\sqrt{x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{x^5+4x^{-2}}x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=3x^2-3x^{-4}+4x-5,\\quad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=6x+12x^{-5}+4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac13x^3+\\frac14x+7,\\quad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=x^2+\\frac14\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=-3x^2+x^{-3/2}+15,\\quad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=-6x-\\frac32x^{-5/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac17x^{-6/7}+\\frac17x^{-8/7}-\\frac19,\\quad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac6{49}x^{-13/7}-\\frac8{49}x^{-15/7}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=2x^4+x\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=8x^3+1,\\quad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=24x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=4x^{3/2}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=6x^{1/2},\\quad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=3x^{-1/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">g)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=2x^{-1/2}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=-x^{-3/2},\\quad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac32x^{-5/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">h)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=x^4+4x^{-3}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=4x^3-12x^{-4},\\quad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=12x^2+48x^{-5}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Find the value of the gradient of the curve at the given points:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^2+5x-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^3-2x+4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac1{\\sqrt{x}}-2x^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sqrt{x}-x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{x^4-3x^3}x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,-4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=2x+5\\text{ so }\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=1}=7\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=3x^2-2\\text{ so }\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=-2}=10\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=x^{-1/2}-2x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac12x^{-3/2}-4x\\text{ so }\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=4}=-\\frac1{16}-16=-\\frac{257}{16}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac12x^{-1/2}-1\\text{ so }\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=4}=\\frac14-1=-\\frac34\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=x^3-3x^2\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=3x^2-6x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=2}=12-12=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f''(1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for each of these:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^3-5x^2+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac1{x^2}-x^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\sqrt{x}+2x^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=x\\sqrt[3]{x}-4x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=p\\sqrt{x}-\\dfrac4{qx}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\\ne0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=3x^2-10x\\text{ so }f''(x)=6x-10\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f''(1)=-4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^{-2}-x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=-2x^{-3}-2x\\text{ so }f''(x)=6x^{-4}-2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f''(1)=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^{1/2}+2x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=\\frac12x^{-1/2}+4x\\text{ so }f''(x)=-\\frac14x^{-3/2}+4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f''(1)=\\frac{15}4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^{4/3}-4x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=\\frac43x^{1/3}-4\\text{ so }f''(x)=\\frac49x^{-4/3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f''(1)=\\frac49\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=px^{1/2}-\\frac4q x^{-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=\\frac12px^{-1/2}+\\frac4qx^{-2}\\text{ so }f''(x)=-\\frac14px^{-3/2}-\\frac8qx^{-3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f''(1)=-\\frac14p-\\frac8q\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q12","number":12,"question":"<p><strong>Prerequisite knowledge for Q12--Q17: Differentiation of the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ae^{kx}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></strong></p><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f'(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for each of these:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^{2x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^{13x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^{-8x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^{x/5}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^{-4x/7}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=2e^{3x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=5e^{-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac14e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac1{e^{5x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\sqrt{e^{3x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{e^x}{\\sqrt{e^x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{e^x}{\\sqrt{e^{6x}}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\sqrt{e^{ax}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{e^x}{\\sqrt{e^{ax}}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=2e^{2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=13e^{13x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=-8e^{-8x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=\\frac15e^{x/5}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=-\\frac47e^{-4x/7}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=6e^{3x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">g)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=-5e^{-x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">h)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=-\\frac12e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">i)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^{-5x}\\text{ so }f'(x)=-5e^{-5x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">j)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^{3x/2}\\text{ so }f'(x)=\\frac32e^{3x/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">k)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^xe^{-x/2}=e^{x/2}\\text{ so }f'(x)=\\frac12e^{x/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">l)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^xe^{-3x}=e^{-2x}\\text{ so }f'(x)=-2e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">m)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^{ax/2}\\text{ so }f'(x)=\\frac a2e^{ax/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">n)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^xe^{-ax/2}=e^{(1-a/2)x}\\text{ so }f'(x)=\\left(1-\\frac a2\\right)e^{(1-a/2)x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for each of these:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2e^{2x}-5e^{3x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2x-e^{3x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=e^{-x}+x^5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^5-\\dfrac14x^4+3e^{-x/5}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sqrt{x}+\\dfrac3{e^{2x}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sqrt{ax}+\\dfrac5{e^{bx}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=4e^{2x}-15e^{3x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=2-3e^{3x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=-e^{-x}+5x^4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=5x^4-x^3-\\frac35e^{-x/5}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=x^{1/2}+3e^{-2x}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac12x^{-1/2}-6e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\sqrt a x^{1/2}+5e^{-bx}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{\\sqrt a}2 x^{-1/2}-5be^{-bx}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f'(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f''(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for each of these:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=e^{3x}+8e^{-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=5x^2-e^{5x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=2e^{-x}+x^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^4-8e^{-x/2}-\\dfrac12x^{-3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=3e^{3x}-8e^{-x}\\text{ so }f''(x)=9e^{3x}+8e^{-x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=10x-5e^{5x}\\text{ so }f''(x)=10-25e^{5x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=-2e^{-x}+2x\\text{ so }f''(x)=2e^{-x}+2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=4x^3+4e^{-x/2}+\\frac32x^{-4}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{so }f''(x)=12x^2-2e^{-x/2}-6x^{-5}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Find the value of the gradient of the curve at the given points, giving your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=5e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^2-e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x-e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,1-e)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2(x+e^{2x})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(\\dfrac12,1+2e\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-3(x+e^{ax})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,-3-3e^a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=e^x\\text{ so }\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=2}=e^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=5e^x\\text{ so }\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=-1}=5e^{-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=2x-e^x\\text{ so }\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=0}=0-1=-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}=1-e^x,\\quad\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=1}=1-e\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=2x+2e^{2x}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=2+4e^{2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=1/2}=2+4e\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=-3x-3e^{ax}\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=-3-3ae^{ax}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=1}=-3-3ae^a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q16","number":16,"question":"<p>The graph below shows the curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3(x-e^x)+5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the value of the gradient at each of the points where the curve meets the axes giving your answers to 2 decimal places.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.31/questions/assets/q16.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=3x-3e^x+5\\text{ so }\\frac{dy}{dx}=3-3e^x.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=-1.423}=3-3e^{-1.423}=2.28\\text{ (2 d.p.)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=0}=3-3e^0=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=0.969}=3-3e^{0.969}=-4.91\\text{ (2 d.p.)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.31-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>Find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that the second derivative of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{k}{e^{px}}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is always positive.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=ke^{-px},\\quad\\frac{dy}{dx}=-pke^{-px},\\quad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=p^2ke^{-px}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^{-px}&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p^2ke^{-px}=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\\ne0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p^2ke^{-px}&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\\ne0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&lt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p^2ke^{-px}&lt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\\ne0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]